:730680117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2481914114,"text":"えっと…ちょっと聞いてみただけだよ！蝶々がいたら追いかけるし、トカゲがいたら捕まえるだろ…本能みたいなもんだ。","nextNodeIds":[730680118]},{"nodeId":730680118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":2549667034,"text":"パイモン、空飛ぶネコ？","nextNodeIds":[730680119]},{"nodeId":730680119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":82011466,"text":"ちがーう！","nextNodeIds":[730680120]},{"nodeId":730680120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":150319138,"text":"えっと…アランナラの秘密とかなら、全然言わなくていいぞ。オイラたちもそこまで興味ないし…だよな？","nextNodeIds":[730680121]},{"nodeId":730680121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1733924770,"text":"すごく興味はあるけどね。","nextNodeIds":[730680122]},{"nodeId":730680122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2904475882,"text":"いや、それはそうなんだけどな…！","nextNodeIds":[730680123]},{"nodeId":730680123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":1863545850,"text":"「秘密」？アランカラに「秘密」ない。アランカラはなにもしてない。アランカラは待ってた。","nextNodeIds":[730680124]},{"nodeId":730680124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3816249922,"text":"待ってた？他のアランナラをか？","nextNodeIds":[730680125]},{"nodeId":730680125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":4089573394,"text":"アランナクラは、アランパンドゥとアシャヴァンレルムへ行った。いつ帰るか分からない。ヴァルナ神器がよくないから、苗畑のお世話してる場合じゃない。うん。","nextNodeIds":[730680126]},{"nodeId":730680126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":2187628314,"text":"#ナラ{NICKNAME}、農作業…好き？","nextNodeIds":[730680127,730680129]},{"nodeId":730680127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1897415698,"text":"農作業は面倒くさい。","nextNodeIds":[730680128]},{"nodeId":730680128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":3229534818,"text":"ワルカで農作業、大変。でもヴァーナでは違う。","nextNodeIds":[730680131]},{"nodeId":730680131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3560844010,"text":"なんでオイラには聞いてくれないんだ！","nextNodeIds":[730680132]},{"nodeId":730680132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":975729738,"text":"パイモン、蝶を追いかけて、トカゲ捕まえる。じっとできないなら、農作業ムリ。だから聞かない。","nextNodeIds":[730680133]},{"nodeId":730680133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":564619642,"text":"言い返せない…！とにかく、オイラは過程より、結果が気になるたちなんだ！ここではなにを植えてるんだ？おいしいものか？","nextNodeIds":[730680134]},{"nodeId":730680134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":4227948178,"text":"おいしい、でも他の使い道ある。","nextNodeIds":[730680135]},{"nodeId":730680135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":1113745362,"text":"でもパイモン、空腹なら苗畑はやめてキノコを食べろ。ヴァーナはキノコが多すぎる、少しは食べて減らすべき。","nextNodeIds":[730680136]},{"nodeId":730680136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":3287285178,"text":"とにかく、アランナクラが帰ってこない。何も始められない。","nextNodeIds":[730680137]},{"nodeId":730680137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3201849114,"text":"#そっか。アランナクラの帰りを待つしかなさそうだな…じゃあ行くか、{NICKNAME}。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":730680129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4223443202,"text":"農作業大好き！","nextNodeIds":[730680130]},{"nodeId":730680130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20816,"speakerName":"アランカラ","textMapHash":2040983714,"text":"そうか。アランカラもだ！","nextNodeIds":[730680131]},{"nodeId":730680112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2483400114,"text":"パイモンの言う通り！","nextNodeIds":[730680113]},{"nodeId":730680113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4294786370,"text":"へへっ！","nextNodeIds